1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:07,041
The Verge reports that Meta smart glasses are raising new privacy concerns in workplaces.

2
00:00:06,991 --> 00:00:14,858
Some service workers say customers or managers can record them too easily, sometimes for online content.

3
00:00:14,858 --> 00:00:27,182
Supporters see useful hands-free technology, but critics warn that laws and company policies have not kept up with small, wearable cameras and AI features.

